    "detailed_description": "Play quick card duels, open booster packs to discover new cards with powerful synergies and build your best deck in this Singleplayer Roguelike Deckbuilder inspired by Trading Card Games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Trading Card Game Simulator:</strong> Experience the joy of Trading Card Games without having to spend real-world currency on booster packs.<br></li><li> <strong>Booster packs:</strong> Open booster packs to obtain exciting new cards.<br></li><li> <strong>Card market:</strong> Buy and sell cards but make sure it's the right decision for your card collection.<br></li><li> <strong>Runic Powers:</strong> Powerful upgrades that give you various advantages.<br></li><li> <strong>Deckbuilding:</strong> Builds decks with potent synergies.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living demo roadmap:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924990/extras/65fbfefdd48c8fcf1a102d7a455e3c14.avif?t=1743858275\" width=540 height=1200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flow:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Open booster packs</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924990/extras/7d3f7659c320d56542fa7d5d6bc01c01.poster.avif?t=1743858275\" width=578 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924990/extras/7d3f7659c320d56542fa7d5d6bc01c01.webm?t=1743858275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924990/extras/7d3f7659c320d56542fa7d5d6bc01c01.mp4?t=1743858275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> <strong>Build your deck</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st